# 📘 Notes App Backend – Spring Boot

A RESTful API for managing engineering subject notes. Designed for students and educators to organize, search, and manage academic content efficiently.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 📚 Subject management (create, update, delete, list)
- 📝 Note CRUD operations with metadata
- 🔍 Search and filter notes by keyword, subject, tags, and date
- 🏷️ Tagging system for flexible categorization
- 👤 Optional user authentication (JWT-based)
- 📤 Export/import notes (PDF/Markdown) *(optional)*
- 🕰️ Versioning and history tracking *(optional)*
- 📌 Favorite/pinned notes *(optional)*
- 📊 Dashboard insights *(optional)*

---

## 🧩 Functional Modules Explained

### 1. Subject Management
- Add, update, delete, and list engineering subjects.
- Organize notes under specific subjects.

### 2. Note Management
- Create, view, update, and delete notes.
- Associate notes with subjects.
- Search notes by title/content.
- List notes by subject.

### 3. Tagging System *(Optional)*
- Add tags to notes (e.g., "Exam", "Formula").
- Filter notes by tags.
- Manage tag list.

### 4. User Management *(Optional)*
- Register/login with JWT authentication.
- Role-based access (admin/user).
- User-specific note visibility.

### 5. Search & Filter
- Full-text search across notes.
- Filter by subject, tags, or date range.

### 6. Note Metadata
- Created and updated timestamps.
- Author info (if user system is enabled).

### 7. Export/Import *(Optional)*
- Export notes to PDF or Markdown.
- Import notes from structured files.

### 8. Versioning *(Optional)*
- Maintain edit history.
- Restore previous versions.

### 9. Favorites *(Optional)*
- Mark notes as favorites.
- List pinned notes.

### 10. Dashboard *(Optional)*
- Stats: notes per subject, popular tags, recent activity.

