## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Backend**: Spring Boot, Spring Data JPA
- **Database**: MySQL / PostgreSQL / H2 (your choice)
- **Security**: Spring Security + JWT *(optional)*
- **Documentation**: Swagger/OpenAPI

